WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.033 --> 00:00:00.567
At least

00:00:00.567 --> 00:00:01.868
two people are dead

00:00:01.868 --> 00:00:03.636
and at least 30 wounded

00:00:03.636 --> 00:00:05.739
after a Russian attack hit

00:00:05.739 --> 00:00:06.706
medical science

00:00:06.706 --> 00:00:09.175
in the Ukrainian city of the Dnipro

00:00:09.209 --> 00:00:11.611
Hospital. Was among the sites damaged.

00:00:11.611 --> 00:00:14.047
The mayor said it's a miracle.

00:00:14.080 --> 00:00:16.116
Doctors were changing shifts

00:00:16.116 --> 00:00:17.117
when the attack happened.

00:00:17.117 --> 00:00:19.052
It means that fewer people were working

00:00:19.052 --> 00:00:20.253
at the time. Of the strike.

00:00:20.253 --> 00:00:22.288
Sirens could be heard over.

00:00:22.288 --> 00:00:23.123
Keefe

00:00:29.429 --> 00:00:30.897
and sirens

00:00:30.897 --> 00:00:32.399
just heard that happening

00:00:32.399 --> 00:00:34.134
as drone and missile strikes

00:00:34.134 --> 00:00:35.135
occurred overnight.

00:00:35.135 --> 00:00:36.136
Ukraine says it

00:00:36.136 --> 00:00:39.606
shot down ten missiles and over 20 drones

00:00:39.906 --> 00:00:40.807
across the border.

00:00:40.807 --> 00:00:42.909
The Russians are reporting more attacks

00:00:43.209 --> 00:00:46.246
inside the Belgorod region further away.

00:00:46.279 --> 00:00:47.480
An explosion

00:00:47.480 --> 00:00:49.883
has been reported in the Russian city

00:00:49.883 --> 00:00:51.584
of Krasnodar.

00:00:51.584 --> 00:00:52.452
Social media video

00:00:52.452 --> 00:00:53.787
appears to show a drone

00:00:53.787 --> 00:00:55.622
flying above the city.

00:00:55.622 --> 00:00:56.823
Moments later,

00:00:56.823 --> 00:00:58.458
there is some kind of blast.

00:00:58.458 --> 00:01:01.161
Fred Pleitgen is in Ukraine's capital,

00:01:01.361 --> 00:01:01.728
Kiev.

00:01:01.728 --> 00:01:02.395
Let's talk

00:01:02.395 --> 00:01:03.496
more about the attack

00:01:03.496 --> 00:01:05.532
on this medical facility.

00:01:06.099 --> 00:01:08.735
Fred, we know that two people are dead.

00:01:08.768 --> 00:01:09.569
Just walk us through

00:01:09.569 --> 00:01:10.570
what happened and just sort of

00:01:10.570 --> 00:01:11.771
set the scene for us in terms

00:01:11.771 --> 00:01:13.139
of what you know so far

00:01:15.542 --> 00:01:15.809
Yeah, this

00:01:15.809 --> 00:01:16.943
happened in the early

00:01:17.010 --> 00:01:18.344
morning hours of this morning

00:01:18.344 --> 00:01:19.579
as it happened.

00:01:19.579 --> 00:01:20.013
As you already

00:01:20.013 --> 00:01:20.880
very correctly

00:01:20.880 --> 00:01:21.648
put it, as

00:01:21.648 --> 00:01:22.949
there were air strikes going on

00:01:22.949 --> 00:01:23.783
Russian strikes

00:01:23.783 --> 00:01:24.517
throughout the country,

00:01:24.517 --> 00:01:25.752
throughout Ukraine here, in fact,

00:01:25.752 --> 00:01:27.020
in the early morning hours.

00:01:27.020 --> 00:01:27.720
And overnight,

00:01:27.720 --> 00:01:29.322
we did hear sirens here in Kiev.

00:01:29.322 --> 00:01:30.523
And we also heard

00:01:30.523 --> 00:01:32.759
the air defenses here around Kiev at work

00:01:32.759 --> 00:01:34.461
at well as well.

00:01:34.461 --> 00:01:35.728
The strike on Dnipro happened

00:01:35.728 --> 00:01:36.529
a little bit later

00:01:36.529 --> 00:01:38.398
in the morning hours of this morning,

00:01:38.398 --> 00:01:39.933
and it hit that medical facility,

00:01:39.933 --> 00:01:42.001
which also has a veterinarian facility

00:01:42.001 --> 00:01:42.969
nearby as well.

00:01:42.969 --> 00:01:44.070
And some of the video

00:01:44.070 --> 00:01:45.805
that was coming out of that area

00:01:45.805 --> 00:01:46.973
in the early stages

00:01:46.973 --> 00:01:48.708
was just absolutely horrifying

00:01:48.708 --> 00:01:49.742
where injured people

00:01:49.742 --> 00:01:50.944
were trying to save themselves

00:01:50.944 --> 00:01:52.278
and get out of that building.

00:01:52.278 --> 00:01:53.613
People were helping them get out.

00:01:53.613 --> 00:01:55.248
A lot of people drenched

00:01:55.248 --> 00:01:56.282
in blood, essentially.

00:01:56.282 --> 00:01:57.050
And then, of course,

00:01:57.050 --> 00:01:59.085
you have that total of 30 people

00:01:59.085 --> 00:01:59.819
who were injured,

00:01:59.819 --> 00:02:01.054
a lot of them still in hospital,

00:02:01.054 --> 00:02:02.789
some of them in quite critical condition.

00:02:02.789 --> 00:02:05.024
And two people who have been killed now.

00:02:05.291 --> 00:02:06.559
The latest that we have

00:02:06.559 --> 00:02:07.727
from the Ukrainians

00:02:07.727 --> 00:02:08.461
is they say

00:02:08.461 --> 00:02:09.362
that they believe

00:02:09.362 --> 00:02:10.497
that for this strike

00:02:10.497 --> 00:02:12.332
that hit that medical facility

00:02:12.332 --> 00:02:14.100
that ballistic missiles were used

00:02:14.100 --> 00:02:15.869
on the part of the Russians, either

00:02:15.869 --> 00:02:17.971
S-300 or S-400 missiles.

00:02:17.971 --> 00:02:18.905
And just to put that

00:02:18.905 --> 00:02:21.007
into context for our viewers.

00:02:21.007 --> 00:02:22.041
Those are missiles

00:02:22.041 --> 00:02:23.009
that are normally used

00:02:23.009 --> 00:02:24.244
to shoot down airplanes.

00:02:24.244 --> 00:02:24.744
However,

00:02:24.744 --> 00:02:25.845
they also have a mode

00:02:25.845 --> 00:02:27.046
where they can be used against

00:02:27.046 --> 00:02:28.014
ground targets

00:02:28.014 --> 00:02:29.983
in a surface to surface configuration.

00:02:29.983 --> 00:02:30.717
However,

00:02:30.717 --> 00:02:32.452
when you use them that way,

00:02:32.452 --> 00:02:34.387
they become extremely inaccurate.

00:02:34.387 --> 00:02:35.021
And of course,

00:02:35.021 --> 00:02:35.388
if you

00:02:35.388 --> 00:02:36.456
then use them to shoot

00:02:36.456 --> 00:02:37.891
into an urban area,

00:02:37.891 --> 00:02:39.058
the kind of things happen

00:02:39.058 --> 00:02:40.527
that happens today

00:02:40.527 --> 00:02:41.060
where this is

00:02:41.060 --> 00:02:42.962
a medical facility was hit and,

00:02:42.962 --> 00:02:43.229
you know,

00:02:43.229 --> 00:02:43.696
it was

00:02:43.696 --> 00:02:44.564
obviously pretty much

00:02:44.564 --> 00:02:45.632
completely destroyed.

00:02:45.632 --> 00:02:47.100
A big fire broke out.

00:02:47.100 --> 00:02:49.469
Rescue crews are still on the scene

00:02:49.469 --> 00:02:50.203
looking to see whether

00:02:50.203 --> 00:02:52.105
there are further survivors or people,

00:02:52.105 --> 00:02:54.674
some maybe still buried

00:02:54.674 --> 00:02:55.742
beneath the rubble there.

00:02:55.742 --> 00:02:56.776
So a major strike.

00:02:56.776 --> 00:02:57.877
It's been condemned

00:02:57.877 --> 00:02:59.345
by Ukraine's president,

00:02:59.345 --> 00:03:00.914
by the first lady of Ukraine,

00:03:00.914 --> 00:03:02.949
by countries internationally as well.

00:03:02.949 --> 00:03:03.550
But, of course,

00:03:03.550 --> 00:03:04.784
that is something that we've seen

00:03:04.784 --> 00:03:06.553
very frequently here in Ukraine.

00:03:06.553 --> 00:03:07.620
But we've had these massive

00:03:07.620 --> 00:03:09.389
missile strikes across the country

00:03:09.389 --> 00:03:12.392
that in some cases have also hit civilian

00:03:12.392 --> 00:03:13.560
facilities as well Zain.

00:03:14.527 --> 00:03:15.695
Fred Pleitgen live for us there.

00:03:15.695 --> 00:03:16.996
Thank you so much.

00:03:16.996 --> 00:03:17.363
CNN's

00:03:17.363 --> 00:03:19.232
Jim Colby has just arrived

00:03:19.232 --> 00:03:21.167
and joins us live now

00:03:21.167 --> 00:03:21.834
So, Sam, here's the thing.

00:03:21.834 --> 00:03:22.769
The mayor was saying

00:03:22.769 --> 00:03:23.403
that doctors

00:03:23.403 --> 00:03:25.471
were actually changing their shift

00:03:25.772 --> 00:03:27.006
when this strike happened,

00:03:27.006 --> 00:03:27.774
and that's a miracle

00:03:27.774 --> 00:03:28.641
because it meant that

00:03:28.641 --> 00:03:30.743
fewer people were actually working

00:03:30.777 --> 00:03:31.511
Just talk

00:03:31.511 --> 00:03:32.045
talk us through

00:03:32.045 --> 00:03:32.712
what you're seeing

00:03:32.712 --> 00:03:34.881
and hearing on the ground there.

00:03:36.482 --> 00:03:38.251
Well, saying it was a fluke

00:03:38.251 --> 00:03:39.852
if there's any good fortune

00:03:39.852 --> 00:03:42.355
in this very gruesome outcome.

00:03:42.355 --> 00:03:44.691
But the scale of the

00:03:45.225 --> 00:03:46.326
devastation on this

00:03:46.326 --> 00:03:47.860
building is quite obvious.

00:03:47.860 --> 00:03:49.162
This was not one of those

00:03:49.162 --> 00:03:50.563
Iranian side drones

00:03:50.563 --> 00:03:52.765
carrying a mere 40 kilograms of high

00:03:52.765 --> 00:03:54.334
explosive, deadly.

00:03:54.334 --> 00:03:56.035
Those they they are

00:03:56.035 --> 00:03:58.171
they've been supplied in vast quantities

00:03:58.538 --> 00:03:59.906
to the Iranians,

00:03:59.906 --> 00:04:01.274
by the Iranians, to the Russians.

00:04:01.274 --> 00:04:03.943
This is something quite different.

00:04:04.010 --> 00:04:05.712
There's been some speculation

00:04:05.712 --> 00:04:06.846
by government officials here

00:04:06.846 --> 00:04:08.948
that this may have been an S-300,

00:04:08.948 --> 00:04:10.483
which is an enormous

00:04:10.483 --> 00:04:12.452
traditional anti-aircraft missile,

00:04:12.452 --> 00:04:14.921
but it's been used increasingly

00:04:14.921 --> 00:04:16.322
ruthlessly by the

00:04:17.323 --> 00:04:17.824
excuse me,

00:04:17.824 --> 00:04:20.960
by the Russians against civilian targets.

00:04:20.994 --> 00:04:23.763
Now, this is a medical facility, Zain,

00:04:24.397 --> 00:04:28.167
And as such would be more than 40 other

00:04:28.501 --> 00:04:29.702
medical facilities

00:04:29.702 --> 00:04:31.004
have been hit

00:04:31.004 --> 00:04:31.638
in the course

00:04:31.638 --> 00:04:33.873
of just over a year of this war.

00:04:34.040 --> 00:04:36.209
Prosecuted by Russia against Ukraine.

00:04:36.676 --> 00:04:38.811
The French government, among others

00:04:38.811 --> 00:04:40.813
in the international community, have said

00:04:40.813 --> 00:04:43.650
that the targeting of medical facilities

00:04:43.650 --> 00:04:45.218
amounts to a war crime.

00:04:45.218 --> 00:04:46.452
Now, the Russians could

00:04:46.452 --> 00:04:48.221
perhaps argue that this

00:04:48.221 --> 00:04:50.790
is an accident due to poor targeting,

00:04:50.790 --> 00:04:52.058
but it is also

00:04:52.058 --> 00:04:55.261
in a densely populated residential area.

00:04:55.395 --> 00:04:57.297
If you just look over here,

00:04:57.297 --> 00:04:59.766
behind this fence here, a block of flats

00:04:59.766 --> 00:05:00.633
and other block of flats,

00:05:00.633 --> 00:05:02.835
they're not a block of flats there.

00:05:02.835 --> 00:05:05.104
It's all a residential area.

00:05:05.104 --> 00:05:06.139
There's even

00:05:06.172 --> 00:05:08.074
a football pitch being built

00:05:08.074 --> 00:05:09.542
just over here, a soccer pitch,

00:05:09.542 --> 00:05:10.777
I should say.

00:05:11.010 --> 00:05:14.947
And this is what the Russians are intent

00:05:14.947 --> 00:05:15.548
on doing.

00:05:15.548 --> 00:05:16.282
Taking down

00:05:16.282 --> 00:05:18.885
and destroying a medical clinic.

00:05:18.918 --> 00:05:19.752
More than 40

00:05:19.752 --> 00:05:22.789
others have been destroyed or attacked

00:05:22.789 --> 00:05:24.791
by Russia. Over the last year.

00:05:24.791 --> 00:05:25.692
And we saw this,

00:05:25.692 --> 00:05:26.392
of course,

00:05:26.392 --> 00:05:27.760
during the Syrian civil war,

00:05:27.760 --> 00:05:28.861
continue to see, indeed,

00:05:28.861 --> 00:05:29.462
where the Russians

00:05:29.462 --> 00:05:31.464
are also operational

00:05:31.464 --> 00:05:32.365
in both contexts,

00:05:32.365 --> 00:05:34.033
certainly in the Syrian context,

00:05:34.033 --> 00:05:35.802
the absolutely systematic,

00:05:35.802 --> 00:05:37.136
deliberate targeting

00:05:37.136 --> 00:05:38.671
of medical facilities. They

00:05:40.573 --> 00:05:41.341
And just looking

00:05:41.341 --> 00:05:42.275
behind you, I mean, certainly

00:05:42.275 --> 00:05:44.444
a grim task ahead for rescue crews,

00:05:44.444 --> 00:05:46.045
as they may indeed

00:05:46.045 --> 00:05:46.879
still be looking for people

00:05:46.879 --> 00:05:48.915
who might be trapped in the rubble.

00:05:49.382 --> 00:05:50.350
Some highlight for us.

00:05:50.350 --> 00:05:51.284
They're in deep trouble

00:05:51.284 --> 00:05:51.751
on the ground

00:05:51.751 --> 00:05:52.919
outside that medical facility

00:05:52.919 --> 00:05:55.621
